# Development Rules

## Stack
- Next.js App Router with a static export (`output: "export"`), deployed to GitHub Pages.
- Tailwind CSS v4 + shadcn/ui (`base-nova` style, Base UI primitives), configured in `components.json`.
- Theme: the shadcn/ui "Neutral" base color (https://ui.shadcn.com/colors), defined as CSS variables in `src/app/globals.css`.
- Icons: react-icons only (https://react-icons.github.io/react-icons/). Never add `lucide-react` or another icon package.
- Dark mode: `next-themes` with the `class` strategy (default: system).

## UI and UX
- Build UI from shadcn/ui components (https://ui.shadcn.com/) in `src/components/ui`. Check there and in the shadcn registry before writing a custom component.
- Add components with `npx shadcn@latest add <name>`. The CLI generates Lucide imports: replace them with the same icon from `react-icons/lu` (e.g. `XIcon` -> `LuX`, `ChevronRightIcon` -> `LuChevronRight`, `Loader2Icon` -> `LuLoaderCircle`), then `npm uninstall lucide-react` if the CLI installed it.
- Right-click menus must use the shadcn Context Menu component (`npx shadcn@latest add context-menu`) so they look consistent.
- Links that look like buttons: put `buttonVariants()` on `next/link` or `<a>` rather than nesting a link in a button.
- Icon-only controls need an accessible name (`aria-label` or an `sr-only` label) and, when the meaning isn't obvious, a shadcn Tooltip.

## Styling
- Use semantic theme tokens (`bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `text-muted-foreground`, `bg-muted`, `bg-card`, `border`, `ring`). Never hard-code colors (hex, rgb, oklch) in components; add or change tokens in `globals.css` instead.
- Headings use `font-heading` (Space Grotesk); body text uses the default `font-sans` (Geist).
- Merge classes with `cn` from the `cn` package.
- Page content is centered in `max-w-5xl`; long-form reading text uses `max-w-3xl`. Shared long-form typography lives in `src/components/prose.ts`.
- Check every UI change in light and dark mode, and at phone width (the nav becomes a floating bar at the bottom below `md`).

## Code
- Functional components and TypeScript. App components live in `src/components` (PascalCase files) and are re-exported from `src/components/index.ts`. Import client components directly from their files inside other client components.
- Content: profile, home, about and résumé in `src/lib/content.ts`; page metadata and social links in `src/resources/content.tsx`; site config (routes, display toggles, fonts) in `src/resources/site.config.ts`; case studies as MDX in `src/app/work/projects`.
- `npm run lint` (Biome) must pass; `npm run format` applies fixes. `src/components/ui` is vendored shadcn code and is excluded from Biome so it keeps the upstream format.
- `npm run build` must succeed before pushing; pushing to `main` deploys.
